        {
          "id": "d24-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Lumen Education — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Lumen Education — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The following pages present Lumen Education's Q4 2025 operating review. The period was characterised by strong new-logo growth offset by elevated churn in one region; management attention centred on vocational learning platforms fundamentals, cost discipline and platform reliability.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The API Gateway platform is owned by the Payments team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Sena Yıldız, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "All figures in this section are rounded; totals may not sum exactly.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 92.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 103.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d24-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 118.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
