        {
          "id": "d24-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q1 2026 the plan assumes modest sequential growth with flat headcount. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $3.6M for Q1 2026, weighted towards fleet renewal.",
